    "outro_values": {
      "type": "outro-values",
      "blocks": {
        "value_original": {
          "type": "value",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "An original, not a print",
            "content": "<p>Because every set is made by a person, no two are exactly alike. Small differences in tone, in where a pearl sits, in how the light catches the top coat — those are not faults. They are the difference between a print and an original, and we would rather explain that than iron it out.</p>"
          }
        },
        "value_by_women": {
          "type": "value",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Made by women, for women",
            "content": "<p>Everyone who makes these nails is a woman, and most of what we know came from wearing them ourselves — the sets that lifted at the edges after a day, the ones that never quite fit, the ones that were beautiful but wrecked your nails. We are building the ones we wanted and could not find.</p>"
          }
        },
        "value_reuse": {
          "type": "value",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Yours to reuse",
            "content": "<p>Applied with tabs, a set comes off clean and survives to be worn again. Keep a few and choose the one that suits where you are going today, rather than committing to one look for a month.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
